              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: All\nFirefox version: Firefox 149.0 (release)\n\n**Preconditions:**\n- Clean profile\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Navigate to: https://www.doubao.com/chat/\n2. Copy any image into clipboard\n3. Attempt to paste the image with Command + V or context menu > Paste\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nImage paste successful\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nUnable to paste image\n\n**Notes:**\n- I reproduced it on macOS, but based on reports it also happens on Windows and Linux\n- Reproducible on the latest Firefox Release and Nightly\n- Reproducible regardless of the ETP setting\n- Works as expected using Chrome\n\n---\n\nCreated from webcompat-user-report:87321592-adce-4e75-a172-2068bbb20ba7",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: All\nFirefox version: Firefox 149.0 (release)\n\n**Preconditions:**\n- Clean profile\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Navigate to: https://www.doubao.com/chat/\n2. Copy any image into clipboard\n3. Attempt to paste the image with Command + V or context menu > Paste\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nImage paste successful\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nUnable to paste image\n\n**Notes:**\n- I reproduced it on macOS, but based on reports it also happens on Windows and Linux\n- Reproducible on the latest Firefox Release and Nightly\n- Reproducible regardless of the ETP setting\n- Works as expected using Chrome\n\n---\n\nCreated from webcompat-user-report:87321592-adce-4e75-a172-2068bbb20ba7",
              "time": "2026-04-08T02:03:35Z"
            }
